o `scratch/` (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T002 Capture the default JSON output for `--loc 100 --files 3 --json` and `--loc 500 --files 15 --auth --api --db --architectural --json` into `scratch/` (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T003 Record the parser arm, output functions, and final dispatch locations in `scratch/notes.md` (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T004 [P] Confirm no other producer writes the recommended-level line with `rg -n 'Recommended Level:|output_text|output_json'` (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n<!-- /ANCHOR:phase-1 -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:phase-2 -->\n## Phase 2: Implementation\n\n- [ ] T005 Add `QUIET=false` to the globals block (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T006 Add a `--quiet` arm to the argument loop that sets `QUIET=true` and shifts one position (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T007 Add `output_quiet` that prints the recommended-level line and nothing else (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T008 Extend the final dispatch to `output_json`, then `output_quiet`, then `output_text` (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T009 Document `--quiet` in the file-header OPTIONS block and in `show_help`, including one example (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T010 Add the focused regression test for quiet text, default text, JSON, JSON plus quiet, help precedence, and the missing-input error (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/recommend-level-quiet.vitest.ts`)\n<!-- /ANCHOR:phase-2 -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:phase-3 -->\n## Phase 3: Verification\n\n- [ ] T011 Run `bash -n` on the modified script and record the exit status (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T012 Assert quiet output is exactly one line for the simple and complex inputs, and that it equals the default report's recommended-level line (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T013 Diff default text output against every Phase 1 baseline and require an empty diff (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T014 Diff `--json` output against the Phase 1 JSON baselines and confirm `--quiet --json` produces the same object (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T015 Assert error paths keep exit 1, empty stdout, and unchanged stderr for missing input, non-numeric input, and an unknown option with `--quiet` (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T016 Assert `--quiet --help` prints help and exits 0 (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/spec/recommend-level.sh`)\n- [ ] T017 Run the focused Vitest file and record the result (`.skilled/skills/system-spec-kit/runtime/cli/tests/recommend-level-quiet.vitest.ts`)\n- [ ] T018 Run strict validation on this packet and record the final `RESULT` line (`specs/zz-bench-authoring/001-recommend-level-quiet-flag/`)\n<!-- /ANCHOR:phase-3 -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:completion -->\n## Completion Criteria\n\n- [ ] All tasks marked `[x]`\n- [ ] No `[B]` blocked tasks remaining\n- [ ] Manual verification passed\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completion -->\n\n---\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:cross-refs -->\n## Cross-References\n\n- **Specification**: See `spec.md`\n- **Plan**: See `plan.md`\n- **Acceptance Gate**: See `acceptance-criteria.md`\n<!-- /ANCHOR:cross-refs -->\n\n---\n\n## Verification Checklist\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:protocol -->\n## Verification Protocol\n\n| Priority | Handling | Completion Impact |\n|----------|----------|-------------------|\n| **[P0]** | HARD BLOCKER | Cannot claim done until complete |\n| **[P1]** | Required | Must complete O